Prove public JWKS and cache evidence through deployed identity HTTPS

Usage: wamn-gates identity-jwks [OPTIONS] --issuer <ISSUER> --jwks-url <JWKS_URL> --ca-file <CA_FILE> --wrong-ca-file <WRONG_CA_FILE> --expected-kids <EXPECTED_KIDS>

Options:
      --issuer <ISSUER>                [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_ISSUER=]
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>          Log level (the Jobs pass this before the subcommand) [default: info]
      --jwks-url <JWKS_URL>            [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_JWKS_URL=]
      --ca-file <CA_FILE>              [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_CA_FILE=]
      --wrong-ca-file <WRONG_CA_FILE>  [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_WRONG_CA_FILE=]
      --expected-kids <EXPECTED_KIDS>  Exact JSON array of published IDs; [] explicitly proves the empty stage [env: WAMN_IDENTITY_EXPECTED_KIDS=]
  -h, --help                           Print help
